---
/**
 * Pratinjau statis tampilan Chat GUI: pesan berlampiran, alur proses kerja tanpa card (penjelasan agen
 * diselipkan tepat di bawah langkahnya, bisa dilipat seperti di aplikasi), jawaban akhir, dan kartu perubahan.
 */
---

<div class="app-preview-card chat-mock" aria-label="Pratinjau tampilan Chat GUI SORAJA ENGINE">
  <div class="mockup-header">
    <div class="window-dots">
      <span class="dot dot-red"></span>
      <span class="dot dot-yellow"></span>
      <span class="dot dot-green"></span>
    </div>
    <span class="mockup-title">SORAJA ENGINE — Chat GUI</span>
    <div class="mockup-tag">PENALARAN TINGGI</div>
  </div>

  <div class="cm-body">
    <div class="cm-user">
      <div class="cm-thumbs">
        <span class="cm-thumb">#1 <i>✓</i></span>
        <span class="cm-thumb">#2 <i>✓</i></span>
      </div>
      Navbar di screenshot ini terpotong di layar kecil. Tolong buat responsif.
    </div>

    <div class="cm-agent">
      <div class="cm-agent-name"><span class="cm-avatar">✳</span> Claude Code <em>Opus 5.5</em></div>

      <details class="cm-work" open>
        <summary class="cm-work-head" title="Klik untuk melipat atau membuka proses kerja">
          <span class="cm-ok">✓</span> <strong>Selesai</strong>
          <span class="cm-dim">1 mnt 23 dtk · 2 dibaca · 1 perintah · 1 berkas diubah</span>
          <span class="cm-diff"><b class="add">+24</b> <b class="del">−6</b></span>
          <span class="cm-chevron" aria-hidden="true">›</span>
        </summary>

        <div class="cm-flow">
          <p class="cm-text">Saya lihat dulu screenshot dan komponen navbarnya.</p>
          <ol class="cm-steps">
            <li><span class="cm-node violet">◆</span><strong>Berpikir</strong><span class="cm-dim cm-italic">Gambar #2 memperlihatkan menu meluap di lebar 375px…</span><span class="cm-time">9 dtk</span></li>
            <li><span class="cm-node sky">▤</span><strong>Membaca</strong><code><b>PNG</b> 01-navbar.png</code></li>
            <li><span class="cm-node sky">▤</span><strong>Membaca</strong><code><b>TSX</b> Navbar.tsx</code><span class="cm-dim">#L1+180</span></li>
          </ol>
          <p class="cm-text">Menu memakai <code>flex</code> tanpa batas lebar, jadi di bawah <code>md</code> saya ganti dengan tombol hamburger.</p>
          <ol class="cm-steps">
            <li><span class="cm-node orange">✎</span><strong>Mengubah</strong><code><b>TSX</b> Navbar.tsx</code><span class="cm-time"><b class="add">+24</b> <b class="del">−6</b> <u>Tinjau</u></span></li>
            <li><span class="cm-node green">❯</span><strong>Menjalankan</strong><code>npx tsc -b</code><span class="cm-time">11 dtk</span></li>
          </ol>
          <div class="cm-chips">
            <span>📁 proj</span><span>🛡 Mode aman</span><span>◔ Penalaran Tinggi</span><span>📎 2 lampiran dibaca agen</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </details>

      <p class="cm-answer">Navbar sekarang responsif: di bawah <code>md</code> menu diganti tombol hamburger, dan <code>tsc -b</code> lolos tanpa error.</p>

      <div class="cm-edits">
        <div class="cm-edits-head">
          <strong>1 berkas diubah</strong>
          <span class="cm-diff"><b class="add">+24</b> <b class="del">−6</b></span>
          <span class="cm-edits-btn">Tinjau semua</span>
        </div>
        <div class="cm-edits-row"><code><b>TSX</b> src/components/Navbar.tsx</code><span class="cm-time"><b class="add">+24</b> <b class="del">−6</b> ›</span></div>
      </div>

      <div class="cm-actions"><span>⧉ Salin jawaban</span><span class="cm-dim">10:44</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
